ummary .............................................................................................................................. 203\nExam Readiness Drill – Chapter Review Questions ............................................................... 204\nLink to this Chapter's Quiz • 205"],[64475,"Chapter 7: Azure Services for Mobile Applications 140\nAn overview of Azure services 140\nAn introduction to distributed systems 141\nCloud architecture 144\nGateway aggregation 145\nBackends for frontends 146\nA materialized view 147\nThe cache-aside pattern 148\nQueue-based load leveling 149\nCompeting consumers 150\nThe publisher/subscriber pattern 151\nThe circuit breaker and retry patterns 151\nAzure service providers and resource types 152\nData stores 154\nRelational database resources 155\nAzure storage 155\nAzure blobs 156\nAzure files 157\nAzure queues 157\nAzure tables 157\nCosmos DB 157\nAzure Cache for Redis 158\nAzure serverless 158\nAzure functions 159\nAzure Logic Apps 161\nAzure Event Grid 162\nDevelopment services 162\nAzure DevOps 163\nVisual Studio App Center 165\nSummary 166"],[85672,"Chapter 7: Building a Photo Storage App Using a Windows Service\nand Azure Storage 306\nTechnical requirements 307\nWindows Services and Windows Compatibility Pack 307\nWindows Services 307\nTable of Contents\n[ v ]\nWindows Compatibility Pack 309\nProject overview 309\nConfiguring Azure Storage 309\nHot and cold storage 312\nStorage redundancy 312\nStorage account 313\nCreating our Windows Service 315\nTesting the class 318\nUsing the Azure Storage Client 321\nConfiguring our Service to Access Azure Storage 323\nFinishing off the Cloud Storage Client 326\nFurther configuration 326\nLogging 330\nOnly uploading images 331\nUploading existing images 333\nInstalling the Windows Service 336\nCode changes 336\nInstallation command 337\nTesting and debugging 339\nStep 1 – check the service is running 340\nStep 2 – check the log file 341\nStep 3 – check the Event Viewer 341\nSu